<!-- ============================================================ DIFFERENTIATOR -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">what makes it different</div>
    <h2>Every tool reads the same page.</h2>
    <p class="lede narrow" style="margin-top:18px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:16px;">
      At the center of every linked project is one file: <code style="font-family:var(--font-mono); background:var(--bg-panel-2); padding:2px 6px; border-radius:5px;">docs/PRODUCT.md</code> — a living record of numbered requirements and dated decisions, written by whomever owns the project. It's the thing Devkeep is built to read, and that Devkeep actively maintains.
    </p>
    <div class="diagram">
      <figure>
        <svg class="diagram-fig" viewBox="0 0 760 300" role="img" aria-label="docs/PRODUCT.md feeding Scribe, Ward, and Judge">
          <g font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13">
            <!-- center doc -->
            <rect x="300" y="130" width="160" height="66" rx="10" fill="var(--bg-panel)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            <text x="380" y="158" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-weight="600" font-size="13">docs/</text>
            <text x="380" y="176" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--accent)" font-weight="600" font-size="13">PRODUCT.md</text>

            <!-- lines to three nodes -->
            <path d="M340,130 C300,90 220,70 130,64" fill="none" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            <path d="M380,130 L380,64" fill="none" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            <path d="M420,130 C460,90 540,70 630,64" fill="none" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.6"/>

            <!-- Scribe node -->
            <rect x="50" y="18" width="160" height="46" rx="9" fill="var(--bg-panel-2)" stroke="var(--line)"/>
            <text x="130" y="46" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-weight="600">Scribe</text>
            <text x="130" y="90" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink-faint)">regenerates only</text>
            <text x="130" y="106" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink-faint)">what changed</text>

            <!-- Ward node -->
            <rect x="300" y="18" width="160" height="46" rx="9" fill="var(--bg-panel-2)" stroke="var(--line)"/>
            <text x="380" y="46" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-weight="600">Ward</text>
            <text x="380" y="90" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink-faint)">checks new code</text>
            <text x="380" y="106" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink-faint)">against the record</text>

            <!-- Judge node -->
            <rect x="550" y="18" width="160" height="46" rx="9" fill="var(--bg-panel-2)" stroke="var(--line)"/>
            <text x="630" y="46" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-weight="600">Judge</text>
            <text x="630" y="90" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink-faint)">audits the whole repo</text>
            <text x="630" y="106" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink-faint)">against it, fresh</text>

            <!-- decorative brackets bottom -->
            <text x="380" y="270" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink-faint)" font-size="12">numbered requirements · dated decisions · one hash each</text>
          </g>
        </svg>
        <figcaption>A change to requirement #24 is a change one file makes — and every tool downstream sees it the same way.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================ MODULES -->
<section class="panel">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">the six keepers</div>
    <h2>Meet the keepers.</h2>
    <div class="module-grid">

      <div class="module-card">
        <div class="top">
          <div class="badge sm"><svg viewBox="0 0 140 140"><rect width="140" height="140" rx="28" fill="#23264D"/><path d="M48,30.9 L24,70 L48,109.1" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M92,30.9 L116,70 L92,109.1" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M58,107 L82,107 L76,97 L73,95 L76,92 L76,91 L64,91 L64,92 L67,95 L64,97 Z" fill="#D9A441"/><ellipse cx="70" cy="91" rx="6" ry="1.6" fill="#23264D"/><path d="M70,34 Q78,41 78,51 Q78,62 73,70 Q71,72 70,75 Q69,72 67,70 Q62,62 62,51 Q62,41 70,34 Z" fill="#D9A441"/><rect x="68.5" y="75" width="3" height="16" fill="#D9A441"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Scribe</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="tag">"Every decision gets a record."</div>
        <p class="desc">Generates and maintains living documentation — architecture notes, decisions, requirements, release notes, and a QA test plan. A chat interface for asking your own codebase questions. Regenerates only what actually changed.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="module-card">
        <div class="top">
          <div class="badge sm"><svg viewBox="0 0 140 140"><rect width="140" height="140" rx="28" fill="#23264D"/><path d="M48,30.9 L24,70 L48,109.1" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M92,30.9 L116,70 L92,109.1" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="70" cy="46.85" r="12.86" fill="#D9A441"/><circle cx="70" cy="46.85" r="6.43" fill="#23264D"/><rect x="65.57" y="54.57" width="8.87" height="51.44" fill="#D9A441"/><rect x="71.48" y="88.00" width="8.87" height="3.86" fill="#D9A441"/><rect x="71.48" y="95.08" width="11.82" height="3.86" fill="#D9A441"/><rect x="71.48" y="102.15" width="8.87" height="3.86" fill="#D9A441"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Crypt</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="tag">"Every system has its secrets."</div>
        <p class="desc">Team secrets, APIs, URLs — all vault-backed and KMS-anchored, with real per-project access control. Not a shared .env file, not a random spreadsheet.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="module-card">
        <div class="top">
          <div class="badge sm"><svg viewBox="0 0 140 140"><rect width="140" height="140" rx="28" fill="#23264D"/><path d="M48,30.9 L24,70 L48,109.1" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M92,30.9 L116,70 L92,109.1" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="70" cy="37" r="3.5" fill="#D9A441"/><rect x="67" y="40" width="6" height="64" fill="#D9A441"/><path d="M73,49 L84,49 L90,55 L84,61 L73,61 Z" fill="#D9A441"/><path d="M67,68 L56,68 L50,74 L56,80 L67,80 Z" fill="#D9A441"/><rect x="64" y="103" width="12" height="3" fill="#D9A441"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Scout</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="tag">"Daily news from beyond the walls."</div>
        <p class="desc">A daily technical-reading digest scoped to your own stack — the one module that looks outward at the industry instead of inward at your repos. A chat interface to tune the results to your interests.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="module-card">
        <div class="top">
          <div class="badge sm"><svg viewBox="0 0 140 140"><rect width="140" height="140" rx="28" fill="#23264D"/><path d="M48,30.9 L24,70 L48,109.1" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M92,30.9 L116,70 L92,109.1" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><g stroke="#D9A441" stroke-linecap="butt"><g stroke-width="6"><line x1="70" y1="59.20" x2="70" y2="34.00"/><line x1="70" y1="80.80" x2="70" y2="106.00"/></g><g stroke-width="3.6"><line x1="63.10" y1="59.20" x2="57.58" y2="50.80"/><line x1="76.90" y1="59.20" x2="82.42" y2="50.80"/><line x1="57.58" y1="62.80" x2="49.30" y2="55.60"/><line x1="82.42" y1="62.80" x2="90.70" y2="55.60"/><line x1="63.10" y1="80.80" x2="57.58" y2="89.20"/><line x1="76.90" y1="80.80" x2="82.42" y2="89.20"/><line x1="57.58" y1="77.20" x2="49.30" y2="84.40"/><line x1="82.42" y1="77.20" x2="90.70" y2="84.40"/></g></g><path d="M50,70 Q70,40 90,70 Q70,100 50,70 Z" fill="#23264D" stroke="#D9A441" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="70" cy="70" r="7" fill="#D9A441"/><circle cx="70" cy="70" r="3" fill="#23264D"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Seer</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="tag">"The view from the throne."</div>
        <p class="desc">Team access management and a GitHub control board for account admins and owners. Keep an eye on access, releases, commits, and spend.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="module-card">
        <div class="top">
          <div class="badge sm"><svg viewBox="0 0 140 140"><rect width="140" height="140" rx="28" fill="#23264D"/><path d="M48,30.9 L24,70 L48,109.1" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M92,30.9 L116,70 L92,109.1" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="70" cy="35.5" r="3.5" fill="#D9A441"/><rect x="68.5" y="39" width="3" height="5" fill="#D9A441"/><rect x="55" y="44" width="30" height="3" rx="1" fill="#D9A441"/><rect x="68" y="47" width="4" height="48" fill="#D9A441"/><path d="M68,95 L72,95 L85,101 L55,101 Z" fill="#D9A441"/><rect x="55" y="101" width="30" height="3" rx="1" fill="#D9A441"/><line x1="55" y1="47" x2="49" y2="60" stroke="#D9A441" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="55" y1="47" x2="61" y2="60" stroke="#D9A441" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M48,60 Q55,68 62,60" fill="none" stroke="#D9A441" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="85" y1="47" x2="79" y2="60" stroke="#D9A441" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="85" y1="47" x2="91" y2="60" stroke="#D9A441" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M78,60 Q85,68 92,60" fill="none" stroke="#D9A441" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Judge</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="tag">"The clearest view is from the outside in."</div>
        <p class="desc">An unattached outside auditor with zero prior context — explores a whole repo cold and produces a real, evidenced report, on demand.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="module-card">
        <div class="top">
